text Naranja_Route119_G32_M00_Text_0819EB8A {
    "The BOSS got interested in the\nresearch they have going here, so he\lsent us out.\pYou quit meddling!"
}

text Naranja_Route119_G32_M00_Text_0819EBEE {
    "Blast it...\nBlasted by a kid..."
}

text Naranja_Route119_G32_M00_Text_0819EC0E {
    "Our BOSS knows everything.\pBut I’m just a GRUNT. What would I know\nabout what he’s thinking?"
}

text Naranja_Route119_G32_M00_Text_0819EC6B {
    "Huh?\nWhat’s a kid doing here?"
}

text Naranja_Route119_G32_M00_Text_0819EC89 {
    "Huh?\nI lost?!"
}

text Naranja_Route119_G32_M00_Text_0819EC97 {
    "Oh, no...\nI’ll catch an earful for losing to a kid...\pI should just take a nap in the bed..."
}

text Naranja_Route119_G32_M00_Text_0819ECF4 {
    "While I was sleeping, everyone went\nupstairs!"
}

text Naranja_Route119_G32_M00_Text_0819ED22 {
    "Wow, you’re really strong!\pI wish I could be a POKéMON TRAINER\nlike you!"
}

text Naranja_Route119_G32_M00_Text_0819ED6B {
    "The PROFESSOR loves rain.\nThat’s a fact.\pBut if it keeps raining, people will be in\ntrouble. That’s another fact.\pAnd thus, the PROFESSOR is studying\nif the rain can be put to good use."
}

text Naranja_Route119_G32_M00_Text_0819EE25 {
    "Hello!\nWe’ve been saved by your actions!\pWhat I don’t understand is what on\nearth the {AQUA}S were up to."
}

text Naranja_Route119_G32_M00_Text_0819EE8B {
    "There’s a bed...\nLet’s take a rest."
}
